# usb_enum_smoke.jgs -- jgraph.usb, the USB layer (device classes plan, stage D5, ADR 0188). A
# JGraph extension with no MATLAB counterpart, so this is a JGraph-only fixture and
# expected/usb_enum_smoke.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in
# helpers/usb_smoke.m, and each answers the same on any Windows machine whatever is plugged in: the
# shapes of the empty and machine-wide answers, and the refusals.

